     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRParticipantHeaderLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRParticipantHeaderLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRParticipantHeaderLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-participant</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-participant</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>participant</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>participant.associatedEntity.id</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>participant.associatedEntity.name</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>participant@typeCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.role</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>participant.functionCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.period</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>participant.time</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.participant:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>participant.associatedEntity</td><td>Le participant professionnel de santé est de type FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.participant:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>participant.associatedEntity</td><td>Le participant structure est de type FRLMOrganisation, cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.participant:device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>participant.associatedEntity</td><td>Le participant système est de type FRLMDevice, cf. FRDeviceLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-participant</code> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-ParticipantExtension.html\">Participant Extensionversion : 1.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension (Participant Extension)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>Porté par l'identifiant de la ressource référencée par extension:party.value[x], selon le type effectif du participant.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>Porté par le nom de la ressource référencée par extension:party.value[x], selon le type effectif du participant.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:type.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.role</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:function.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.period</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:time.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.participant:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(PractitionerRole) — cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.participant:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(Organization) — cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.participant:device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.ht